          '#5 & 6 Glue the bulkhead assembly in place in the wing slot so that the smaller bulkhead is below the wing and faces forward.',
          'Glue a 18 x 18mm piece of depron into the small slot towards the rear of the wing so that it sticks out 6mm on either side.',
          'The two elevon servos go into a single slot, side by side.',
