        problem: 'So I take newly Drongo to try and possibily understand where the problem was, nothing to do the plane seemed sucked from the water; to take it short after many:test run check and so on Drongo was in the air and finally I understand today\'s bad behaviour, the tape under an elevon come almost completely away ( I suppose in the previous flight and water runs it detached partially under air or water pressure but seemed ok anytime I looked at the undersurface), final try gave me a good, as usual, takeoff and a little succesful flight but it was sunset and flying activity was sopped.',
