        problem: 'The session wasn\'t without incident though, my son Daniel had his first crash,not bad in 18 months of flying, it was more of a heavy landing really, but he was gutted that he had broke the nose on his Jet-cat but I had it fixed at the field with some 5min epoxy so he was soon happy again.',
