        title: 'out my 10mm x 10mm square hard wood motor mount stick',
        body: [
          'but after seeing J\'s panther and cougar, i\'m fine with making a slot into the fin.',
          'before gluing in the last 2 bulkheads, the motor mount support is added first.',
          'things interlock and give each other reinforcement.',
          'i cut out my 10mm x 10mm square hard wood motor mount stick.',
          'though i don\'t glue the motor mount stick in just yet, i did position it in its slot as i glue the motor support so that i can make sure there is no slop.',
        ],
        author: 'beanie',
        date: 'Dec 27, 2007',
        source: 'thread',
