          'Hi macbook13, You can refer to post #112 onwards, Get the top canopy profile from the drrawing i provided, print it out, cut the outline, lay it on top of the canopy and trace the outline slowly.',
          'Do it slowly as foam sands down very easily, you may make a mistake and over-sand some areas The side is already shaped as in the drawing side view, no need to have another trace line for that.',
